0..75 Comment "// The identity subject\'s shared declarations, written once and imported by"
76..153 Comment "// every source that reads them (`import \"./circle-base.gandr\" ;`): the empty"
154..224 Comment "// type, the circle, the presented integers and the free naturals, the"
225..303 Comment "// winding number and spinning with their round trips (the book\'s § 8.1), and"
304..381 Comment "// the maps out of the circle the circle sources state their laws over, after"
382..454 Comment "// cubical Agda\'s `Cubical/HITs/S1/Base.agda`. `circle.gandr` states the"
455..527 Comment "// equivalence `winding` the round trips make and what it computes; this"
528..571 Comment "// source states only what the others read."
